<title>UK: HORSE RACING-RUNNERS AND RIDERS FOR CHELTENHAM GOLD CUP.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-RUNNERS AND RIDERS FOR CHELTENHAM GOLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Runners and riders for the grade one Cheltenham Gold Cup steeplechase to be run over three miles and two and a half furlongs (5.3 kms) on Thursday (tabulate under latest form, horse, jockey):</p>
<p> 312   Addington Boy	 A.Dobbin</p>
<p> 131   Banjo		   D.Bridgwater</p>
<p> 532   Barton Bank	   D.Walsh</p>
<p> F61   Challenger du Luc   C.Maude</p>
<p> 1F1   Coome Hill	    J.Osborne</p>
<p> 111   Cyborgo		 C.Swann</p>
<p> 1F1   Danoli		  T.Treacy</p>
<p> 11F   Dorans Pride	  J.Broderick</p>
<p> S11   Dublin Flyer	  B.Powell</p>
<p> 21F   Go Ballistic	  M.Fitzgerald</p>
<p> 1-43  Imperial Call	 C.O'Dwyer</p>
<p> 2-4F  Mr Mulligan	   A.McCoy</p>
<p> 6P2   Nahthen Lad	   R.Farrant</p>
<p> 112   One Man		 R.Dunwoody</p>
<p> 222   Unguided Missile    N.Williamson</p>
<p>Latest betting: 4 to 1 Imperial Call, 5-1 Coome Hill, 6-1 Dorans Pride and Danoli, 8-1 One Man and Dublin Flyer, 10-1 Addington Boy, 14-1 and upwards others</p>
<p>Official off time: 1515 GMT</p>
